 Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]`@commit:` completion stops offering SDD sidecar commits[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]`@commit:` completion — in the ACE prompt bar and in every LSP [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]editor — offers only commits from repositories a human writes code [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]in. SDD sidecar repositories (`plans`, `beads`, `agents`, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`research`) contribute no completion rows, while a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`@commit:<sidecar>@<sha>` reference typed in full still resolves at[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]launch exactly as it does today.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]commit_completion_excludes_sidecars.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/commit_completion_excludes_sidecars.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-ek[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-ek/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Repository kind on the wire, sidecars skipped in commit [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]enumeration[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]core_kind_filter[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core_kind_filter: add a defaulted `kind` field to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`ArtifactRefRepositoryWire` and skip `kind == \"sidecar\"` repositories in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`append_commit_candidates` before spawning `git log`, leaving [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`resolve_commit` and every other kind untouched.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The host labels each repository and proves both surfaces agree[bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]host_repo_kind[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core_kind_filter[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]host_repo_kind: carry `RepoRecord.kind` into `ArtifactRefRepository` and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]its wire form in `artifact_ref_context()`, extend the prompt-bar/LSP [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parity test with a sidecar repository, assert sidecar resolution still [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]succeeds, and correct the two documentation sentences that promise [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commits from every local checkout.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Raise the published sase-core-rs floor[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]core_floor[dim] · [dim][/dim]after host_repo_kind[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core_floor: once the release carrying `core_kind_filter` is published, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]raise the `sase-core-rs` lower bound in `pyproject.toml` so an installed[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase cannot silently run the unfiltered enumeration.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ek","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","phase_bead_id":"sase-ek.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ca8caa78a8044e8341d5835bfd7af188","started_at":"2026-08-03T10:38:42.834424+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-ek","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ek.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ek.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ek.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-ek.land"]}
